# Supercronic crontab for the scheduler service (see docker-compose.yml).
# Schedules in UTC; overridden at container start from JB_SOURCE_WAVE_CRON,
# JB_REFRESH_WAVE_CRON and JB_BACKUP_CRON (defaults live here, overrides
# documented in .env.example). Both jobs log to the container log:
# docker compose logs scheduler. Changing a schedule needs a scheduler
# container restart.
#
# The wave starts just after the 00:00 UTC OpenAlex credit reset; its
# credit-priced stages self-skip when the budget is already spent.
30 1 * * * /bin/bash /app/scripts/refresh_wave.sh
# Weekly source wave: refreshes the primary + reference sources the nightly
# wave never touches (Pure, deals, OpenAPC, DOAJ, JISC) per institution.
# Sunday 22:00 UTC, ahead of the Monday nightly wave so both fit in one
# weekend night; all stages are free routes or self-gating.
0 22 * * 0 /bin/bash /app/scripts/source_wave.sh
# Dump (~10 GB on a full instance) after the wave's priced stages are
# normally done; backup.sh prunes to the newest JB_BACKUP_KEEP archives.
0 4 * * * /bin/sh /app/scripts/backup.sh
